OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 26 DEC
OL,4,G1300FKarthi Gnanasegaram
OL,5,     GKarthi is your host through
OL,6,     GBoxing Day afternoon, with a
OL,7,     Gselection of seasonal favourites.
OL,8,G1600FA Classical Book Club
OL,9,     GMariella Frostrup presents a
OL,10,     Gspecial three-part series
OL,11,     Gexploring the huge range of
OL,12,     Gclassical music inspired by
OL,13,     Gliterature. Expect music from
OL,14,     GHarry Potter to Romeo and Juliet.
OL,15,G1900FRichard Armitage
OL,16,     GAs you settle in for Boxing Day
OL,17,     Gevening, Richard picks his
OL,18,     Gselection of cosy films to
OL,19,     Gsnuggle up to, including
OL,20,     GPaddington, Good Will Hunting,
OL,21,     GSkyfall and Little Women.
